<xs:schema targetNamespace="http://www.fixm.aero/ext/nas/4.4" xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:nas="http://www.fixm.aero/ext/nas/4.4" xmlns:msg="http://www.fixm.aero/app/msg/1.1" xmlns:fb="http://www.fixm.aero/base/4.3" elementFormDefault="qualified" version="4.4.0">
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>The NasMessage package contains NAS specific extensions to the FIXM BasicMessage application package.  It includes NAS-specific metadata and makes use of basic message's MessageCollection for bundling information about multiple flights into one message.

